{
  "name": "Mob Rule",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You use your Cunning Strike feature, you learn the following new way to use your Sneak Attack:</p><ul><li><strong>Bully (Cost: 3d6).</strong> The target has to make a Constitution Saving Throw or all Attack Rolls against it have Advantage until the end of your next turn.</li><li><strong>Cow (Cost: 2d6).</strong> The target has to make a Wisdom Saving Throw or it has Disadvantage on Attack Rolls against you.</li></ul><p>Additionally, you can reduce the die cost of any of your Cunning Strike options by 1 (to a minimum of 0) while none of your target's allies are within 5 feet of it and at least 1 of your allies is within their melee reach. You can do so only once per turn.</p>",
